      "revision": 1374073534,
      "text": "Dioscorea sylvatica is a species of a twining tuberous vine that is native to Africa. It is common and widespread in forest and thicket, throughout the summer rainfall areas of East and Southern Africa."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Dioscorea sylvatica",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dioscorea_sylvatica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29407393,
      "text": "Dioscorea sylvatica adalah spesies tumbuhan merambat berumbi yang berasal dari Afrika. Tumbuhan ini umum dan tersebar luas di hutan dan semak belukar di seluruh wilayah dengan curah hujan musim panas di Afrika Timur dan Afrika Selatan."
    }
